-- Data for the Avatition database. Run AFTER 01_schema.sql.
--
-- cities, airports : 3 cities and their main airports.
-- companies        : the 10 companies from data/aviation_companies.json. Phone, email and website come from
--                    each company's own website or a public directory page (listed in source_urls). Where a
--                    company publishes no phone or email, the column says 'Not publicly listed'. Nothing is invented.
-- flights          : 10 illustrative flights for this project. Times, seats and prices are made up for
--                    development and are not a real timetable.

